    "summary": {
      "value": ""
    },
    "description": "<ul><li><p>At any moment, if you have a full set of active <strong>Soul Beads</strong>, you may spend 40 MP and imbue one equipped weapon with them. Until this spell ends, the weapon gains a <strong>+3 bonus</strong> to Accuracy Checks, and its damage ignores Resistances.</p></li><li><p>If it’s a <strong>melee</strong> weapon, it also gains the <strong>ranged</strong> property, and its attacks can now be launched from afar.</p></li><li><p>If you have that weapon equipped while casting this spell, you may perform a free attack with it as part of the same action.</p></li><li><p>You lose access to <strong>Soul Beads</strong> used, and they don’t count toward the <strong>Clarity Skill</strong> while imbued in your weapon.</p></li><li><p>You can generate <strong>Soul Beads</strong> as normal from the the next turn onwards.</p></li><li><p>Only one weapon can benefit from this Skill at a time.</p></li></ul>",
